Independently computed (python hmac/sha256, key=stored guest token, msg=guest id string):
  hash_hmac('sha256', '910000036', tokenA) = 37e38b07ec0250f5d9f938d43bfe56a300d9f2e70c3da230e5fb0a9f21aaf6c5  (matches Guest A's cache key)
